a phase : 3-4-3 avec le ballon, 3-1-5-1 sans.","Le couloir préféré {T:home:de} : l'axe (27 % des touches).","Le couloir préféré {T:away:de} : le couloir droit (26 % des touches)."],"impact":"Le plan {T:away:de} a tenu jusqu'au bout. Les positions moyennes ne disent pas tout, mais elles disent qui occupait le terrain."},"en":{"lead":"{T:home:sub} announced a 3-4-3 and attacked in a 3-5-2: a team sheet is a starting point, not a contract. On paper, {T:away:sub} lined up in a 4-5-1. On the pitch, in possession, it looked more like a 3-4-3.","keys":["{T:home:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-5-2 with the ball, 3-4-3 without.","{T:away:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-4-3 with the ball, 3-1-5-1 without.","{T:home:pos} favourite lane: the centre (27% of touches).","{T:away:pos} favourite lane: the right wing (26% of touches)."],"impact":"{T:away:pos} plan held to the end. Average positions do not say everything, but they say who owned the space."}},"s3":{"fr":{"lead":"Le pressing, c'était {T:home:sub} : un PPDA de 12,8, contre 20,4 en face. Comprendre : moins de passes laissées à l'adversaire avant de lui sauter dessus.","keys":["Réaction à la perte comparable : 24 % et 21 % des ballons perdus récupérés en moins de 5 s.","10 récupérations hautes pour {T:away:sub} (ballons perdus par l'adversaire dans ses 35 derniers mètres) : autant de départs d'actions à deux pas du but."],"impact":"Presser ne suffit pas : encore faut-il que les ballons récupérés se transforment. Ici, ils ne l'ont pas fait."},"en":{"lead":"The pressing came from {T:home:sub}: a PPDA of 12.8, against 20.4 for the opponents. Translation: fewer passes allowed before jumping on the ball.","keys":["Similar reaction to losing the ball: 24% and 21% won back within 5 s.","10 high regains for {T:away:sub} (balls lost by the opponent in their own 35 metres): that many attacks starting next to goal."],"impact":"Pressing is not enough: the regained balls still have to turn into something. Here, they did not."}},"s4":{"fr":{"lead":"D'un côté, {T:home:sub} et ses petits triangles près du ballon (−0,05) ; de l'autre, {T:away:sub} et ses couloirs bien rangés (−0,98).","keys":["Le carrefour du réseau {T:home:de} : Bryan Ruiz, impliqué dans 84 passes entre titulaires.","{T:away:Sub} : 48 % de passes courtes (moins de 15 m), contre 53 % en moyenne.","Le carrefour du réseau {T:away:de} : Luka Milivojević, impliqué dans 80 passes entre titulaires."],"impact":"Et cette fois, c'est le football positionniste qui l'emporte. Ce n'est pas une loi, c'est un match."},"en":{"lead":"On one side, {T:home:sub} and their little triangles near the ball (−0.05); on the other, {T:away:sub} and their tidy lanes (−0.98).","keys":["The hub of {T:home:pos} network: Bryan Ruiz, involved in 84 passes between starters.","{T:away:sub}: 48% short passes (under 15 m), against 53% on average.","The hub of {T:away:pos} network: Luka Milivojević, involved in 80 passes between starters."],"impact":"And this time, positional football wins. It is not a law, it is a match."}},"s5":{"fr":{"lead":"Perdre le ballon coûtait plus cher à {T:home:sub} : 4 tirs adverses en transition (0,54 xG), contre 2 pour l'autre camp.","keys":["Sans 360, on ne voit pas les courses de repli : seuls les tirs concédés racontent l'histoire."],"impact":"Le match s'est en partie joué là : mieux gérer ses pertes, c'est souvent mieux gérer le score."},"en":{"lead":"Losing the ball cost {T:home:sub} more: 4 opponent shots in transition (0.54 xG), against 2 the other way.","keys":["Without 360, recovery runs are invisible: only the shots conceded tell the story."],"impact":"Part of the match was decided right there: managing your losses is often managing the scoreline."}},"s6":{"fr":{"lead":"Sans 360, on mesure l'attention reçue : Bryan Ruiz a subi 1,16 actions défensives de plus que la normale pour 10 touches.","keys":["Johan Venegas ({T:home:bare}) : +0,97.","Francisco Calvo ({T:home:bare}) : +0,39.","Celso Borges ({T:home:bare}) : +0,36.","À l'autre 